# SITE-SEO-1 (2026-10-13): security headers on every page. The CSP is REPORT-ONLY — it blocks nothing; it reports what an enforcing policy would block.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://www.googletagmanager.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data: https://www.googletagmanager.com https://*.google-analytics.com; connect-src 'self' https://*.google-analytics.com https://*.analytics.google.com https://www.googletagmanager.com; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'
